%%MatrixMarket matrix coordinate real symmetric
% The path5 SDDM operator with ONE off-diagonal flipped positive: symmetric,
% strictly diagonally dominant (|a_ij| unchanged by the flip) and therefore
% SPD, but not an M-matrix. Handed to the factorization unrepaired it would
% become a negative edge weight and break sample_clique's prefix sampler;
% M-matrix lumping (include/apxchol/operator_class.h) moves it onto the
% diagonal before the preconditioner is built. Must converge.
5 5 9
1 1 1.5
2 1 -1
2 2 2.5
3 2 1
3 3 2.5
4 3 -1
4 4 2.5
5 4 -1
5 5 1.5
